  hook: 'One Thursday in Dublin — June 16, 1904 — an ad salesman fries a kidney for breakfast, attends a funeral, watches a young woman on a beach, walks home with a younger man, and gets into bed beside his wife. The novel that follows him is the most ambitious in English.',
  themesBlurb: 'The modern Odysseus, stream of consciousness, Dublin as world, Catholicism and apostasy, the marriage and Molly\'s yes.',
